                  Telephone: <a href="tel:+911145241131" style="color: #70146e; font-weight: 700;">011-45241131</a> | Email: <a href="mailto:nodalofficer@prestloans.com" style="color: #f05a28; font-weight: 700;">nodalofficer@prestloans.com</a><br>
                  Working Hours: Monday to Friday (10:00 AM – 6:00 PM)
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>

